  "note": "The fixed cohort swept on a schedule. Two kinds deliberately, retail and news, run together: it costs the same and it shows which audience has the more shocking result. Rung one is ten of each. Do not skip rungs to fifty or two hundred without re-reading the cost cap in scripts/sweep.ts.",
  "target_note": "Each target is the site's own homepage, not a deep product or article URL. Deep URLs rot within weeks and a rotted URL would show up as a readability failure that is really our bookkeeping error. The homepage is stable, is the page every crawler reaches first, and is what the published number is explicitly labelled as measuring.",
